[00:03.428]Do me wrong, do me right,
{"伤害我也好　善待我也罢"}
[00:10.391]Tell me lies but hold me tight,
{"用谎言哄我　但请抱紧我吧"}
[00:17.481]Save your goodbyes for the morning light,
{"把告别留待破晓时分"}
[00:22.913]But don't let me be lonely tonight.
{"但今夜别让我独自一人"}
[00:32.112]Say goodbye and say hello,
{"道别之后又相迎"}
[00:37.976]Sure enough good to see you, but it's time to go,
{"见到你固然欢喜　但该走了"}
[00:45.902]Don't say yes but please don't say no,
{"别答应我　但也别拒绝"}
[00:50.962]I don't want to be lonely tonight.
{"今夜我不想独自一人"}
[00:58.873]Go away then, damn you,
{"那就滚吧　该死的"}
[01:01.999]Go on and do as you please,
{"随你便吧　爱怎样都行"}
[01:06.067]You ain't gonna see me gettin down on my knees.
{"休想看我卑躬屈膝"}
[01:13.928]I'm undecided, and your hearts been divided,
{"我犹豫不决　而你三心二意"}
[01:19.422]You've been turning my world upside down.
{"你把我的世界搅得天翻地覆"}
[01:32.158]Do me wrong, do me right （right now baby）,
{"伤害我也好　善待我也罢（就现在宝贝）"}
[01:39.168]Go on and tell me lies but hold me tight.
{"尽管用谎言哄我　但请抱紧我"}
[01:45.672]Save your goodbyes for the morning light（morning light）,
{"把告别留待破晓时分（破晓时分）"}
[01:51.185]But don't let me be lonely tonight.
{"但今夜别让我独自一人"}
[01:58.300]I don't want to be lonely tonight.
{"今夜我不想独自一人"}
[02:03.470]No, no, I don't want to be lonely tonight.
{"不　不　今夜我不想独自一人"}
[02:39.242]I don't want to be lonely tonight.
{"今夜我不想独自一人"}
